@anon.bcaf8a6642ef434db28a340da408f3d7.2010 = private unnamed_addr constant [455 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for too few positional arguments for a `logging` format string.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AA `TypeError` will be raised if the statement is run.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Aimport logging\0A\0Atry:\0A    function()\0Aexcept Exception as e:\0A    logging.error(\22%s error occurred: %s\22, e)\0A    raise\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Aimport logging\0A\0Atry:\0A    function()\0Aexcept Exception as e:\0A    logging.error(\22%s error occurred: %s\22, type(e), e)\0A    raise\0A```\0A", align 1
